# Per-run scratch written by pipeline steps — belongs on the Trello card and in
# the issue thread, never in this (public) repo. See Learnings log 2026-08-24.
*STEP*REPORT*.md
drafts_*.txt
*-capture-results.json

# NOTE (2026-08-25, CLO-87): the 2026-08-24 entry claims this file also covers
# "the capture/move scratch JSON". It did not, and four such files are ALREADY
# TRACKED at the repo root — CLO-39-cards.json (which publishes 9 prospect email
# addresses), CLO-39-capture-results.json, move-instructions.json and
# trello-move-map.json. Ignoring a tracked path has no effect, so they are still
# public. tools/brand-capture/run-sweep.mjs and run-clo39-captures.ps1 write two
# of them to the repo root by design. Untracking them without moving the tooling
# to PAPERCLIP_RUN_SCRATCH_DIR would break those scripts, so it is a code change,
# not a .gitignore change. Tracked as its own issue.
